<title>USA: AAR signs maintenance contracts.</title>
<headline>AAR signs maintenance contracts.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>AAR Corp said Thursday it signed multi-year maintenance contracts with American Eagle Inc, a subsidiary of AMR Corp, and Polar Air Cargo a worldwide cargo carrier.</p>
<p>The value of the contracts was not disclosed.</p>
<p>AAR will refinish American Eagle's Saab SF340 and ATR 42 asnd ATR 72 aircraft exteriors. For Polar Air Cargo, it will overhaul the landing gear and flap carriage assemblies on 12 Boeing 747 aircraft that comprise the cargo carrier's growing fleet.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
